npcRoles.AT_Ice_King.name = Ice King
npcRoles.AT_Ice_King_Lightning_Stuck.name = Ice Bolt
npcRoles.AT_Ice_King_Ice_Pillar.name = Ice Pillar
items.AT_Ice_King_Crown.name = Ice King's Crown
items.AT_Ice_King_Nunchucks.name = Ice King's Ice Nunchucks
items.AT_Ice_King_Warmth_Potion.name = Warmth Potion
items.AT_Ice_King_Warmth_Potion.description = Keeps you warm for 10 minutes: the Ice King's magic can't freeze you, it only slows you a little, and you can't burn.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Ray.name = Ice Ray Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Ray.description = Casts the Ice King's ice ray. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
npcRoles.AT_Snowman.name = Snowman Henchman
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Zap.name = Zap Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Zap.description = ZAP! A quick, weak ice bolt that adds half a frost stack. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Nova.name = Ice Nova Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Nova.description = An ice explosion around you that throws enemies back and adds two frost stacks. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Iceberg.name = Iceberg Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Iceberg.description = Drops an iceberg where you aim. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Rain.name = Ice Rain Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Rain.description = Ice shards rain down for a few seconds where you aim. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Freezing_Ray.name = Freezing Ray Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Freezing_Ray.description = The Ice King's freezing ray: freezes what it hits for a moment. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Chain_Rays.name = Chain Frost Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Chain_Rays.description = A freezing ray that jumps from enemy to enemy, up to four hits. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ultimate.name = Ice... KING! Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ultimate.description = Charge up and fire the Ice King's giant frost beam. The last hit freezes. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Mace.name = Ice Mace Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Mace.description = Slam the ground three times; each slam sends out an ice shock wave. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Sword.name = Ice Sword Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Sword.description = The Ice King's ice sword combo: two swings and a chop, stepping forward. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Frost_Burst.name = Frost Burst Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Frost_Burst.description = Five quick ice bolts; if all of them hit, the target freezes. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Shield.name = Ice Shield Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Shield.description = Cover yourself in an ice bubble that cuts the damage you take, then burst it to throw back and freeze whoever is near. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Lightning.name = Ice Lightning Rune
items.AT_Ice_King_Rune_Ice_Lightning.description = Calls a giant ice ray down from the sky where you aim. Needs ice magic: only works while you wear the Ice King's Crown.
